### 19. Test deactivating business unit with active contracts (should fail)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/business-units/1
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "is_active": false
}

### 20. Test deleting business unit with active contracts (should fail)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/business-units/1
Authorization: {{token}}
